This directory contains public headers for the `joint_controller` firmware.

Key files:
- `config_presets.h` and `JointConfig.h` — joint definitions and generated configuration surface
- `JointController.h` — top-level controller interface
- `commands.h`, `common_types.h`, `shared_data.h` — protocol and shared runtime types
- `debug.h`, `global.h`, `safety_system.h` — diagnostics, globals, and safety interfaces
